"Click four known points on the axes in the <font color=\"red\">order shown "
"in red</font>. Two on the X axis (X1, X2) and two on the Y axis (Y1, Y2)"
msgstr ""
"Щёлкните по четырём известным точкам на осях в <font color=\"red\">порядке, "
"показанном красным</font>. Две на оси X (X1, X2) и две на оси Y (Y1, Y2)"

#: templates/_popups.html:471
msgid ""
"Click on two known points (P1, P2) on the continuous axes along the bars"
